WEBVTT

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:51.000
"Battleship <i>Yamashiro</i> "

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.120
Ouch...

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.700
Hmm... This is a mystery.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.620
Are you sure you have no idea?

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.160
This is Sakura Empire's secret weapon, right?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:13.080
I'm just a repair ship.
I don't know any details about this...

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:21.700
Who would've thought they
got it secretly from the Sirens...

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:25.830
This must be some
seriously bad stuff. I'm scared...

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.200
I have returned.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.500
Welcome back. How was it?

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.620
Scout planes are patrolling.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:39.830
They have clearly figured out
that we are hiding on this island.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:44.160
What should we do?

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:48.370
The base knows our situation.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.830
We should wait for a rescue.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:55.540
That said, I doubt that
the Sakura Empire would sit idly by.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.200
Hot! Too hot!

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:07.790
Do you think they might let us go
if we gave this back to them?

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.580
Of course not.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:13.040
If they catch me, they'll use me
to make a shamisen!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:30.750
Are these ships safe? Won't the enemy
take control or something?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:36.120
The Orochi is the host, so we can't
lose control, according to Akagi.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:44.790
Akagi... What exactly is
this scheme she's plotting?

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:46.410
Shoukaku?

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:50.540
I'm super uncomfortable
around those sinister types.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.910
I have failed and let the enemy escape.

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:06.540
I must clear my name of this...

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:10.250
Oh, Takao, you've got that frown again.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:14.870
"Heavy Cruiser <i>Atago</i> "

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.450
Atago?!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:14.870
See how tense your muscles
are around here?

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.200
Hey, wait...

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.950
S-Stop...

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:23.830
Hmm?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.370
Would you like some, too, Ayanami?

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:31.290
No, I respectfully decline.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:32.910
What are you doing?!

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.330
We're on mission. Take this seriously.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.080
Yes, ma'am...

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.870
How is the island looking?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.870
It's a ruin that's practically built for hiding in.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.120
Finding them won't be easy.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:01.620
We can't get impatient. Let's wait
for the scout planes to find them.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:05.660
But Fusou, I'm worried about
Akashi, who got kidnapped.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:05.660
"Battleship <i>Fusou</i>"

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:08.120
We can't just wait around.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:12.580
Fusou, we got a report from the Iron Blood fleet.

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:19.450
Azur Lane!

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:23.500
"Destroyer <i>Z1</i> "                                                     "Light Cruiser <i>Köln</i> "

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.750
Yes, I'm certain.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.700
What do we do? Do we take them out first?

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.750
Our job is to watch the island.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.410
Let's let the Sakura Empire deal with them.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.500
There's a whole lot of buildings
on such a small island.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.370
"Battleship <i>Oklahoma</i> "

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:42.370
I think it used to house
a large number of residents.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.750
It's totally ruined...

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:50.080
The island was abandoned
after the Sirens attacked.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:53.160
A-Ah...

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.500
"Heavy Cruiser <i>Suffolk</i> "

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.080
Pretty seagulls.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:06.040
"Battlecruiser <i>Repulse</i> "

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:06.040
As if we don't have enough enemies already...

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:09.830
"Heavy Cruiser <i>Norfolk</i>"

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:09.830
Huh? I-Is something wrong?

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:13.370
What are we doing, really?
Humans against humans?

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.120
They took the upper hand.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:27.870
But now there is no doubt
that they are hiding on that island.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:32.830
What's your plan for rescue? It wouldn't
be easy to break through that blockade.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:37.790
Our priority is rescue. I don't want to
take unnecessary risks to endanger them.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.080
I wonder what Belfast thinks.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.750
You're calm.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:48.870
Excuse me?

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:52.830
Aren't you worried? I thought the ones
on the island are your close companions.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:57.080
Yes, they are maids as well,
serving under the Queen.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:05.450
It's quite strange. We're ships,
but all this talk about maids and queens...

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.250
As if we're imitating...

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.500
As if we're imitating humans.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.620
Is that what you want to say?

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.870
It makes no difference.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.330
People, ships--there is no difference.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:23.160
We are all alive. We all have hearts.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:28.540
No, we were born to fight.
We're not like humans.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:32.000
Yes...

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:36.750
We possess immense strength,
which comes with great responsibilities.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.870
Yes. To defeat our enemies.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.910
That won't be enough.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.250
We must continue to provide proof.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.450
Proof?

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.080
No matter how difficult life
becomes on this world,

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:01.660
we can live a proud, noble life.

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:07.790
We must serve as an example for
people who have lost their way.

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:12.370
For that, we must always be elegant.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.500
And the job of a maid is to assist in
achieving elegance in all aspects of life.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.830
That's not how we think in the Eagle Union.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:26.330
Of course. That is why we
Azur Lane must assist each other.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:31.580
Royal Navy, Eagle Union, Dragon Empery,
Iris the Liberty, Northern Parliament.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.870
As well as Iron Blood and Sakura Empire.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:36.580
In the past.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.790
I wonder if Ayanami is here.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.700
Maybe.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:55.540
If I see her again, I...

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.290
Concerns?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.200
If you want to talk about
something, I can listen.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.290
Atago?!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.500
I am... fine.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.750
You don't have to be so cautious...

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:24.000
Do you have hesitations towards fighting?

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:30.540
I don't dislike fighting.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.290
But you don't like it either?

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:38.040
I love everyone in the Sakura Empire.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.870
They are my precious friends.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.830
But...

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.580
It is the same on the other side.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:50.660
They have friends, like I do.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.370
They laugh with each other...

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:10.950
It feels weird.

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.330
It seems like we've been found.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:52.660
Wh-What should we do?!
W-We have to get out of here!

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.700
But the island is surrounded!

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:00.660
No, now is the best time to escape.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.830
The Sakura Empire scout plane
has found the target.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.370
Well, I guess it's time
to put in some serious effort.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.620
It's a piece of cake, now that I'm here!

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:17.870
It may not be quite so easy.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:35.370
All right, I've got to be sharp!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.080
Aim...

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.120
Pow!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:51.950
All guns, fire a volley!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.660
Fire!

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:07.410
The Azur Lane are making their move.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.450
This is a diversion.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:27.330
They must be trying to use the fog
and chaos to rescue their friends.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:31.250
We cannot just rely
solely on the Iron Blood...

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.870
Ayanami!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.200
We are moving out!

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:43.290
Even though it might be a diversion,
we can't ignore the enemy fleet completely.

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.000
We'll take care of that.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.410
If the Grey Ghost is there...

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:49.910
This time, I'll win!

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.790
It has begun.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.290
We should hurry, too!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.410
Not good...

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.200
What?!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:40.790
Takao!

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:48.040
Worst timing possible...

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.160
Laffey! Javelin! Watch out!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:11.040
Ayanami...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.790
Enemy planes, incoming!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.450
Where are you, Grey Ghost?!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.330
The enemy seems strong!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.000
I-I'll do my best...

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:25.450
Sorry! We don't have time for you!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:35.870
Interceptors! Are you here, Grey Ghost?!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.160
Zuikaku! You can't rush in like that!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:55.870
<i>Feuer!</i>

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.410
There!

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.290
Sheffy!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:11.290
Sheffy!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.700
How's that?!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:15.910
Our combination tactics are invincible!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:30.120
This is bad... I wonder if
I can sneak away...?

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:56.620
Go ahead.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:57.830
But...

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:02.200
It's okay, I'm pretty strong. Besides...

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.080
You're worried, aren't you?

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.410
Okay, let's do this!

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.870
Wait!

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.750
I'll take you both on at once!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:35.080
Again? Enough of this!

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.870
Why won't you fight?!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.660
Laffey?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.000
Laffey!

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:38.750
Bel...!

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:43.080
Oh, so you decided to show up, Belfast.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:48.080
But I'm sorry to say, you're one move
too late. It seems like we win this time.

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:08.200
Right, go!

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:27.040
No, the victory is ours. It is you
who are one move too late.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.500
What...?

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:42.120
Sorry, I think you're going
after the wrong sister.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.000
It can't be!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.370
After all that you've said...

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:58.160
You're really soft-hearted, too, Belfast!

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:05.160
Enterprise...

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.500
Retreat...

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.330
Here we go...

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.950
Why...?

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.160
Why won't you fight?!

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:52.370
I don't want to fight you.

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:00.700
But we're enemies...!

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:05.870
It doesn't matter.
I want to be friends with you.

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:15.750
Oh... I see.

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:18.830
Now I understand.

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:22.950
I wanted to be friends with her, too.

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
